<p>The Lewis form factor <InlineEquation equation="Y" /> simplifies this expression:</p>
<p>Imperial form :</p>

<DisplayEquation equation="\\sigma = \\frac{F_t P}{bY}" title="" />

<p>Metric form :</p>

<DisplayEquation equation="\\sigma = \\frac{F_t}{b m Y}" title="" />

